  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The jars made available for download are really not useful. For maven projects, they would depend on the repository, and get the jars automatically. For non-maven projects, they would be unable to use the jar, as there is no dependencies included.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I have made a patch for this, using maven's assembly plugin",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
